},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"d7W1Fi6uRYUhDT_uW83d7w","review_id":"CMj1v7UusBWMOJan5DGSxA","date":"2013-11-27T17:02:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387252926826477,"text_excerpt":"Allway's is such a little gem in this city. Chances are, whatever kind of show ya dig, you will find something that will satisfy your tastes one night here. Burlesque, theater, music, comedy - I've seen them all at this venue. The stage is front and center in the first room and there is a bigger theater in the back. I love to grab a seat at the bar (hopefully Rusty is bartending) and enjoy the show (both on stage and behind the bar). There is usually a cover for most shows, but it is worth the experience. My personal favorites here are any Bella Blue burlesque production and any local brass bands (Local Skank being the best). In between shows, the bar is pretty chill and usually pretty sl..."},{"business_id":"d7W1Fi6uRYUhDT_uW83d7w","review_id":"AoGKaJF5K1yIJhT19AGI9Q","date":"2013-08-20T15:52:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9328298568725586,"text_excerpt":"I've only ever been here for Burlesque (Dirty Dime and the School of Burlesque Student Showcase), but hell m' f'in yeah! I love the bartenders here. Allways amazing with attentive service and generous pours. There is so much character and so many characters that visit the bar. Also, I've noticed that the space appeals even to preppy more conservative folk despite the alternative vibe. I know that may be a minus for some, but it's a plus for me so I can drag some Uptown friends out of their neighborhood. I usually sit at the bar where you can get a direct view of the stage (as long as it's not too packed). Also, even though they don't have food, we brought some over from Kukhnya across the..."},{"business_id":"d7W1Fi6uRYUhDT_uW83d7w","review_id":"Fvtt8JjlszlQJNLSLotpeQ","date":"2018-08-27T13:59:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326531291007996,"text_excerpt":"I had a great time at this local neighborhood lounge. This is a spot where you see a lot of locals and they were very pleasant and welcoming. Initially my girlfriend and I went her to do jitterbug dance classes, which they offer absolutely free of charge. We arrived earlier because they had a burlesque show and some other things going on before the dance class. I had no idea what a burlesque was, but it was like a classy strip show. Anyway, the lounge I absolutely loved but it was a little tight and got really crowded around 9:30 give or take. I mean people came out of nowhere for the dance classes and just a great time. The locals were very nice and you didn't have to look over your shou..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"d7W1Fi6uRYUhDT_uW83d7w","photo_id":"1KDwp2oaFS5LUDWRPg39qQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1KDwp2oaFS5LUDWRPg39qQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9531643986701965},{"business_id":"d7W1Fi6uRYUhDT_uW83d7w","photo_id":"